      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_12",
      "hash64": "EFB9A1B47EB18738",
      "text": "Hmm, du hast irgendwie was Besonderes an dir.\\nMein Interesse ist geweckt![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_13",
      "hash64": "EFB9A2B47EB188EB",
      "text": "Ich werde eine Weile hier im Dorf mein Lager\\naufschlagen.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_side02_0000_camera_14",
      "hash64": "EFB9A7B47EB1916A",
      "text": "Sprich mich doch wieder an, wenn du all deine\\nAufgaben erledigt hast.\\c\\nZum Beispiel wenn du, sagen wir, 150 Pokémon\\naus dem Kitakami-Pokédex gefangen hast, hm?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
